		(property "Description" "The ISL21080 analog voltage references feature low supply voltage operation at ultra-low 310nA typical, 1.5uA maximum operating current. Additionally, the ISL21080 family features ensured initial accuracy as low as +/-0.2% and 50ppm/C temperature coefficient. These references are ideal for general-purpose portable applications to extend battery life at a lower cost. The ISL21080 is provided in the industry standard 3 Ld SOT-23 pinout. The ISL21080 output voltages can be used as precision voltage sources for"
